? Missing component
* Nodes
* 0 - Ground
* 2 - Common node in the middle (connected to RD1, RD2, and the gates of M2 and M4)
* 3 - Output node (Vout)
* 4 - VDD node
* 5 - Source of I2 and M3, M4
* 6 - Source of I1 and M1, M2
* 7 - Gate of M3
* 8 - Node after RD1 (connected to Vout)
* 9 - Gate of M1
